This directory is the build project the APIMatic CLI copies into a temporary
directory to generate a documentation portal. It is distributed under the MIT
licence, with the rest of @apimatic/cli.

It is derived from the Fumadocs and TanStack Start starter templates, and at
build time it runs against the packages below. Each is MIT licensed and carries
its own copyright:

  Fumadocs (fumadocs-core, fumadocs-ui, fumadocs-mdx, fumadocs-openapi)
    Copyright (c) 2023 Fuma Nama

  TanStack Start and TanStack Router (@tanstack/react-start, @tanstack/react-router,
  @tanstack/start-static-server-functions)
    Copyright (c) 2021-present Tanner Linsley

  Shiki, Tailwind CSS, React and Vite are likewise MIT licensed; see their own
  packages for the full notices.

The generated portal also bundles the Geist and Geist Mono typefaces, from the
Fontsource packages @fontsource-variable/geist and @fontsource-variable/geist-mono.
They are licensed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1, not MIT:

  Geist and Geist Mono
    Copyright 2024 The Geist Project Authors (https://github.com/vercel/geist-font)
